<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655163482" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngenali lan Nggabungake Suku-suku Sajinis</title><para id="fs-id1170655355506">Wujud aljabar dumadi saka suku-suku. <emphasis effect="bold">Suku</emphasis> yaiku konstanta, utawa asil ping-pingan saka sawijining konstanta karo siji utawa sawetara variabel.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655355510">
<title>Suku</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655081102"><term id="term-00019">Suku</term> yaiku konstanta, utawa asil ping-pingan saka sawijining konstanta karo siji utawa sawetara variabel.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655106479">Tuladha suku yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654944550">Konstanta sing ngepingake variabel diarani <emphasis effect="bold">koefisien</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1171789962795"><newline/><newline/></para>
<note id="fs-id1170654944554">
<title>Koefisien</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655190285"><term id="term-00020">Koefisien</term> sawijining suku yaiku konstanta sing ngepingake variabel ing suku kasebut.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655108012">Anggepen koefisien minangka wilangan ing ngarep variabel. Koefisien suku 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> yaiku 3. Nalika kita nulis <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, koefisiene yaiku 1 amarga <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<example id="fs-id1170654958635">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654958637">
<problem id="fs-id1170654958640">
<para id="fs-id1170655199112">Temtokna koefisien saben suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655353600">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166425225066"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Koefisien 14<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> yaiku 14.<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓑ</span> Koefisien <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku 15.<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓒ</span> Koefisien <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> yaiku 1 amarga <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654942248" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942251">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942254">
<para id="fs-id1170654942256">Temtokna koefisien saben suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>41</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">z</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943070">
<para id="fs-id1170654943072"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 17 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 41 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654941712" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654941715">
<problem id="fs-id1170654941718">
<para id="fs-id1170654941720">Temtokna koefisien saben suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9<emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941893">
<para id="fs-id1170654941895"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 13 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654944001">Sawetara suku nduweni ciri sing padha. Gatekna 6 suku ing ngisor iki. Suku endi sing katon nduweni ciri sing padha?</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655066427" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654943858">7 lan 4 loro-lorone kalebu suku konstanta.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654943862">Suku <emphasis effect="italics">5x</emphasis> lan 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> loro-lorone suku sing ngemot <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654944183">Suku <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> loro-lorone suku sing ngemot <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655192776">Yen loro suku arupa konstanta utawa nduweni variabel lan eksponen sing padha, loro-lorone diarani <emphasis effect="bold">suku sajinis</emphasis>.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166422559187" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>7 lan 4 kalebu suku sajinis.</item>
<item>5<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> kalebu suku sajinis.</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> kalebu suku sajinis.</item>
</list>
<note id="fs-id1170654936881">
<title>Suku Sajinis</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654936541">Suku-suku sing kabeh arupa konstanta utawa nduweni variabel sing padha kanthi pangkat sing padha diarani <term id="term-00021">suku sajinis</term>.</para>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170654936780">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654936782">
<problem id="fs-id1170654936784">
<para id="fs-id1170654936786">Temtokna suku-suku sajinis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 14, 23, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 9<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655189504">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654942212"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> kalebu suku sajinis amarga loro-lorone ngemot <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> variabel lan eksponene padha.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654940949"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> kalebu suku sajinis amarga loro-lorone ngemot <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> variabel lan eksponene padha.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654935536">14 lan 23 kalebu suku sajinis amarga loro-lorone arupa konstanta.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655195762">Ora ana suku liyane sing sajinis karo 9<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654932190" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655163424">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163426">
<para id="fs-id1170655163428">Temtokna suku-suku sajinis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654932121">
<para id="fs-id1170654936607">9 lan 15, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654942110" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942820">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942822">
<para id="fs-id1170654942824">Temtokna suku-suku sajinis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 19, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 24, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655162912">
<para id="fs-id1170654936398">19 lan 24, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655174214">Nggunggungake utawa ngurangi suku-suku mbentuk sawijining ekspresi. Ing ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> saka <link target-id="fs-id1170655171250"/>, telung sukune yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan 8.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654944433">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654944435">
<problem id="fs-id1170654940658">
<para id="fs-id1170654940660">Temtokna suku-suku ing saben ekspresi.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166422654836" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941538">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<list id="fs-id1166422254836" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Suku-suku saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 7<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, lan 12.<newline/><newline/>
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Suku-suku saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku 8<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 3<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>.</item></list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654944577" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654944216">
<problem id="fs-id1170654944218">
<para id="fs-id1170654944220">Temtokna suku-suku ing ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654942970">
<para id="fs-id1170654942642"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654943428" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654943433">
<problem id="fs-id1170654943435">
<para id="fs-id1170654943822">Temtokna suku-suku ing ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654940732">
<para id="fs-id1170654940734">5<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, 2<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654943110">Yen sawijining ekspresi ngemot suku-suku sajinis, ekspresi kasebut bisa digawe luwih prasaja kanthi nggabungake suku-suku sajinis. Miturut panjenengan, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> bisa digawe luwih prasaja dadi apa? Yen panjenengan mangsuli 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, wangsulan kasebut bener!</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654940806" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="1em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="1em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654936709">Gunggungen koefisiene lan tetep gunakna variabel sing padha. Nilai <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> ora dadi prakara—yen panjenengan nduweni 4 barang, nambahi 7 barang sajinis, banjur nambahi 1 maneh, asile yaiku 12 barang. Tuladhane, 4 jeruk ditambah 7 jeruk ditambah 1 jeruk padha karo 12 jeruk. Sipat-sipat matematika sing dadi dhasare bakal dirembug mengko.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654940628">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654936258">Gunggungen koefisiene. 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></para>
<example id="fs-id1170654940588">
<title>Cara Nggabungake Suku Sajinis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654940590">
<problem id="fs-id1170654940592">
<para id="fs-id1170654941823">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941968">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<media id="fs-id1170655224688" alt="Gambar iki nduweni rong kolom: pituduh langkah kapisan ing kiwa lan rong larik wujud aljabar ing tengen. Larik pituduh kapisan ing kiwa muni: “Langkah 1. Temtokna suku-suku sajinis.” Ing tengen, jejere langkah 1, ana wujud aljabar 2x kuadrat ditambah 3x ditambah 7 ditambah x kuadrat ditambah 4x ditambah 5. Siji larik ing ngisore, ekspresi sing padha dibaleni, nanging saben suku nggunakake salah siji saka telung warna kanggo nuduhake suku-suku sajinis: 2x kuadrat lan x kuadrat awarna abang; 3x lan 4x awarna biru; 7 lan 5 awarna ijo.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014a_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<media id="fs-id1170653192952" alt="Larik pituduh kapindho ing kiwa muni: “Langkah 2. Tatanen maneh ekspresine supaya suku-suku sajinis jejer.” Ing tengen, jejere langkah 2, ana wujud aljabar wiwitan sing susunan sukune diowahi supaya suku-suku sajinis jejer: 2x kuadrat ditambah x kuadrat, loro-lorone awarna abang; ditambah 3x ditambah 4x, loro-lorone awarna biru; ditambah 7 ditambah 5, loro-lorone awarna ijo.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014b_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<media id="fs-id1170655041754" alt="Larik pituduh katelu ing kiwa muni: “Langkah 3. Gabungna suku-suku sajinis.” Ing tengen, jejere langkah 3, ana wujud aljabar sawise suku-suku sajinis digabungake: 3x kuadrat awarna abang, ditambah 7x awarna biru, ditambah 12 awarna ijo.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014c_new.jpg"/>
</media>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655124954" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655165458">
<problem id="fs-id1170655165461">
<para id="fs-id1170655165463">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654944751">
<para id="fs-id1170654944753"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655106279" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655106283">
<problem id="fs-id1170655206781">
<para id="fs-id1170655206783">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654924801">
<para id="fs-id1170654936363"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205372" class="howto">
<title>Gabungna suku-suku sajinis.</title>
<list id="fs-id1166425014151" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise">
<item>Temtokna suku-suku sajinis.</item>
<item>Tatanen maneh ekspresine supaya suku-suku sajinis jejer.</item>
<item>Gunggungen utawa kurangana koefisiene lan tetep gunakna variabel sing padha kanggo saben klompok suku sajinis.</item>
</list>
</note>
</section>